      "content": "<section class=\"page\" id=\"source-page-11\" data-page=\"11\"><h2 data-generated=\"true\">Page 11</h2><article class=\"element\" data-kind=\"header\" data-element-id=\"node_b3f131b5fc55336047a641306fbb6342\"><p data-node-id=\"node_b3f131b5fc55336047a641306fbb6342\" data-source-id=\"fbf7728e-ed4f-4d24-8dd2-48b6363bc449\">UNIVERSITY OF<br> MARYLAND<br> School of Pharmacy</p></article><article class=\"element\" data-kind=\"header\" data-element-id=\"node_7de308811c9a3a504c2fa8d560fa789e\"><p data-node-id=\"node_7de308811c9a3a504c2fa8d560fa789e\" data-source-id=\"4d8a62b4-ce33-4b5e-ab5f-31fd8985ff09\">Batch Record<br> MBR-046</p></article><article class=\"element\" data-kind=\"header\" data-element-id=\"node_d91a12cb8bfe1ac84b591d50354cd108\"><p data-node-id=\"node_d91a12cb8bfe1ac84b591d50354cd108\" data-source-id=\"0997e1cf-b231-4e85-9d4b-c4255105d160\">Supersedes:<br><br>New</p></article><article class=\"element\" data-kind=\"header\" data-element-id=\"node_78b9d0bd4f84c6e0049c9085a9ed1e5c\"><p data-node-id=\"node_78b9d0bd4f84c6e0049c9085a9ed1e5c\" data-source-id=\"78c4c9ea-7a62-479d-80d3-446cf1b8ec58\">Version:<br><br>1.0</p></article><article class=\"element\" data-kind=\"header\" data-element-id=\"node_b2cb920a6e5aa2958966b3b526280e2f\"><p data-node-id=\"node_b2cb920a6e5aa2958966b3b526280e2f\" data-source-id=\"f0e61308-63be-4e5c-bc2f-003976789bfd\">Title: Fexo A - Fexofenadine HCI tablets<br> 60mg (F-7046)</p></article><article class=\"element\" data-kind=\"header\" data-element-id=\"node_cef3aea417836e5489f7d4d1df0b903f\"><p data-node-id=\"node_cef3aea417836e5489f7d4d1df0b903f\" data-source-id=\"41e0eca6-b14e-47c1-bd6d-1ebb79b951ee\">Effective:</p></article><article class=\"element\" data-kind=\"page_number\" data-element-id=\"node_b80c868a49161943f18ac9de43951677\"><p data-node-id=\"node_b80c868a49161943f18ac9de43951677\" data-source-id=\"afd71e2a-36ca-4650-b6f1-35ba8c286312\">Page 10 of 17</p></article><article class=\"element\" data-kind=\"ta